Immerse yourself in a memorable experience with a relaxing LoFi soundtrack and unique visuals that will leave you extremely satisfied.

You are responsible for constructing the runway for the airplane to take off. To do this, fit the runway cubes correctly into the indicated positions on the platform.

- 40 levels;
- Original soundtrack;
- Satisfying puzzles;
- Low poly visuals;

Embark on this memorable experience with a great and relaxing soundtrack and a beautiful view that will get you extremely satisfied.

You are responsible for irrigating the plantation on the islands. To do that, put the water cubes correctly in the indicated position to make the crops grow healthily.

Features:
- 40 levels;
- Original soundtrack;
- Satisfactory puzzles;
- Low poly;

Cube Railway is na exciting puzzle game that challenges players to strategically fit blocks to complete the construction of a railway track and allow the train to move forward. With 40 levels filled with increasingly challenging puzzles, each stage presents a specific number of available moves, making every decision crucial for success. If players fail to fit the blocks correctly within the move limit, the stage resets for a new attempt. The game features na original soundtrack that creates na immersive and captivating atmosphere, complemented by stunning low poly visuals that make the experience visually appealing and unique. With simple controls, Cube Railway is perfect for players of all ages looking for satisfying challenges in a charming setting.

Features:
- 40 levels;
- Original soundtrack;
- Satisfying puzzles;
- Low poly visuals;

