Welcome to puppy village! Labby needs your help with a top-secret mission: creating a video game just for dogs (move over, cats!).

Find 500+ hidden dogs and items scattered across 15 cozy, hand-drawn levels in the English countryside. Got stuck? Just blow the dog whistle! Keep finding pups to watch the map grow and come to life with moving planes, boats, and trains!

